      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("“<i>Barren Throne</i>”, “<i>Angel of Ashes</i>”; don’t people have better things to do than gossip all day about this vapid prophecy? I put my trust in steel, not seers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("My Liege, I fear you give insufficient weight to—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("And “<i>Sceptre of the Wesfolk</i>” is the worst of it all... as if it’s my fault Haldric’s dwarves lost the accursed thing. _ Even the wife! Ever since Delfador first told us about that prophecy, all I get from Asheviere is gossip; rumors about nobles and expeditions and treasure-seekers and other such nonsense. What do you make of it all, brother?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("The Sceptre of Fire may have gone missing years ago, but it is still well-known as Wesnoth’s symbol of kingship, among lords and common-folk alike. _ My spies have heard nothing of these sceptre-hunters. But if they are real and a noble actually manages to find and retrieve the Sceptre, well, such a misfortune could put your claim to the throne in serious jeopardy."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Intrigue and influence, politics and loyalty. I’m lucky to have you, Arand. This isn’t my strength."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("But I use the tools I have. Take General Lionel — there’s a man to rely on! He’s served me loyally for many years; why, I practically trust him more than my own son!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("(bows)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("No offense, boy."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("(scowls)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Still, these rumors cannot be taken lightly. Something must be done...."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Deoran",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
